# A narrow build context; never upload Source, .env, Git or Host credentials.
**
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!prepared/
!prepared/requirements.lock
!prepared/wheelhouse/
!prepared/wheelhouse/*.whl
!prepared/ms-playwright/
!prepared/ms-playwright/**
# Exceptions above must not re-include common secret/metadata paths.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.ssh
**/.ssh/**
**/.aws
**/.aws/**
**/.git
**/.git/**
**/.codex
**/.codex/**
**/.DS_Store
**/credentials
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
